===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[awkward]], [[ungainly]] person.
#* {{RQ:Thackeray Vanity Fair|passage="{{...}} Mrs. Sedley had forgiven his breaking the punch-bowl at the child's party. Don't you remember the catastrophe, Ma'am, seven years ago?"<br>"Over Mrs. Flamingo's crimson silk gown," said good-natured Mrs. Sedley. "What a '''gawky''' it was! And his sisters are not much more graceful. Lady Dobbin was at Highbury last night with three of them. Such figures! my dears."}}
